  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be two vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math> is equal to"
