  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now, solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now, we know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>·</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
